    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Hesai Group, referred to on its website as Hesai Technology, describes itself as a global leader in 3D perception and lidar solutions for ADAS and autonomous mobility. The company says its lidar sensors provide high-resolution 3D perception for advanced driver assistance systems, autonomous vehicles, trucking, robotics, and industrial applications, and that it supplies customers in over 40 countries. It describes lidar as enabling features such as automated emergency braking and navigation on autopilot, and says its sensors meet standards for L4+ autonomous driving in robotaxis and robobuses.\n\nThe company's website positions it as a partner to automotive OEMs, autonomous vehicle, and robotics companies, and says it delivers mass-produced, market-proven lidars. It also mentions enabling physical AI across ADAS, autonomous mobility, robotics, and spatial intelligence.\n\nHesai Group is a public company headquartered in Shanghai, trading under the ticker HSAI, with SEC CIK number 0001861737.",
